# Review: a24aa540b7dac810b4e22740
# Evidence: https://github.com/yeager/translations/blob/e0905a395b3ee2b8b2e60eeaab3e36af72491001/Codeberg Weblate/verified-components/qdmr/graphical-user-interface.ts
